@* Sonner's call shape over Toastify. The server can raise one too, without any
   JavaScript at the call site: Ctx.UpEmit("sonner:toast", new { text = "Saved" }) writes a
   response header and Unpoly turns it into the same event. *@
<Button Variant="outline" Type="button"
        data-toast='{"text":"Your changes were saved","type":"success"}'>Show a toast</Button>
<Button Variant="outline" Type="button"
        data-toast='{"text":"Could not reach the server","type":"error"}'>Show an error</Button>
